keywords:
  - teleprompter
  - screen recording
  - speech recognition
  - education
  - presentations
  - offline
  - Electron
  - Vosk
abstract: >-
  Ghostprompter is a free, offline Windows application for recording lectures and presentations. It records the
  screen, webcam and microphone, and shows a floating teleprompter that is excluded from the recording and can
  scroll by following the speaker's voice using on-device speech recognition (Vosk). It does not connect to
  external content sources, AI services or real-time feeds, and sends no data off the user's computer.
